{"title":"2017 AMC 12A Problems/Problem 5","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1_(Basic)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1 (Basic)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Complementary_Counting)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Complementary Counting)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Solution_5\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 5</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Solution_6\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 6</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-9\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">9</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-10\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">10</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>At a gathering of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/1/651ba418a810d971dbc8a326d49a71fe1541fae0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people who all know each other and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people who know no one. People who know each other hug, and people who do not know each other shake hands. How many handshakes occur?\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/e/36e424a1eb98c87745165200b02aadfa250f930e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A)}\\ 240\\qquad\\textbf{(B)}\\ 245\\qquad\\textbf{(C)}\\ 290\\qquad\\textbf{(D)}\\ 480\\qquad\\textbf{(E)}\\ 490$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"439\" height=\"17\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_1_.28Basic.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1_(Basic)\">Solution 1 (Basic)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1 (Basic)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>All of the handshakes will involve at least one person from the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> who knows no one.  Label these ten people <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/f/f/9ffb448918db29f2a72f8f87f421b3b3cad18f95.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$D$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/a/2/fa2fa899f0afb05d6837885523503a2d4df434f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$E$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a055f405829e64a3b70253ab67cb45ed6ed5bb29.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$F$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/2/6e28ce12d49d39f160d5a0ef54077fc98e4b9d2b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$G$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/9/b1902d279ba37d60bdce4e0e987b7cd19d48974e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$H$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"18\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/027f4a11d6090f9eac0ce2488df6384dad1263ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$I$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/b/abb5588023cfa1ac14643e9778699f03eecc57a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$J$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p>Person <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> from the group of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> will initiate a handshake with everyone else (<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/5/0657f5cd42256c0a39d45b265235e2a939625515.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29$\" width=\"17\" height=\"12\" /> people).  Person <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> initiates <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/6/9265f5dd6dade78136a6be158ace46bf7c0f8ce3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$28$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> handshakes plus the one already counted from person <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />.  Person <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/3/c3355896da590fc491a10150a50416687626d7cc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$C$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"16\" height=\"14\" /> initiates <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/0/5/1051e7d41ec0b8bd688a872be17538413f4ee97b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> new handshakes plus the two we already counted.  This continues until person <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/b/b/abb5588023cfa1ac14643e9778699f03eecc57a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$J$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" /> initiates <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> handshakes plus the nine we already counted from <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" /> ... <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/2/7/027f4a11d6090f9eac0ce2488df6384dad1263ea.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$I$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/e/c6e6966c85b1128bee0d68befd5d1dfda6478a66.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$29+28+27+26+25+24+23+22+21+20 = \\boxed{(B)=\\ 245}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"503\" height=\"29\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let the group of people who all know each other be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/9/019e9892786e493964e145e7c5cf7b700314e53b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"15\" height=\"14\" />, and let the group of people who know no one be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. Handshakes occur between each pair <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/e/8/8e8da0aef2d19017da7471378386d61620f288f5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(a,b)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"41\" height=\"20\" /> such that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/a/5/1a50f85686fe7cb27b1ae676014e18fc9e46e9bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a\\in A$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"45\" height=\"14\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/9/9/999e49d223e45c4430a52817a56531e24d7bcb3e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b\\in B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"44\" height=\"13\" />, and between each pair of members in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" />. Thus, the answer is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/6/8c63d146ac26b9dbba69ffd2e06a5c7c8b9b900f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$|A||B|+{|B|\\choose 2} = 20\\cdot 10+{10\\choose 2} = 200+45 = \\boxed{(B)=\\ 245}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"479\" height=\"53\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Complementary_Counting.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Complementary_Counting)\">Solution 3 (Complementary Counting)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Complementary Counting)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The number of handshakes will be equivalent to the difference between the number of total interactions and the number of hugs, which are  <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/1/4/f14ebd820de6c8a7c95732fbca3355ed971fb071.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${30\\choose 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"42\" height=\"53\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/0/49081f336f86e8e6f0ababaad7062b12d9ae75f9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${20\\choose 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"42\" height=\"53\" />, respectively. Thus, the total amount of handshakes  is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/8/bd8fab9b922e42b3eee133c8670c634d5c9b35d2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${30\\choose 2} - {20\\choose 2} = 435 - 190= \\boxed{(B)=\\ 245}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"337\" height=\"53\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Each of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people who do not know anybody will shake hands with all <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> of the people who do know each other. This means there will be at least <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/0/5/e059a6ab20626d1966699085b694f3d60162487b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20 * 10 = 200$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"104\" height=\"13\" /> handshakes. In addition, those <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people will also shake hands with each other, giving us another <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/1/9012c15061efa06a9063c8a8114d2e9c1ad8f00b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$9+8+7+6+5+4+3+2+1 = 45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"301\" height=\"14\" /> handshakes. Therefore, there is a total of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/3/b/c3b3071ebec6e0980776250710ab797166946097.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200+45 = \\boxed{(B) = 245}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"184\" height=\"29\" /> handshakes.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_5\">Solution 5</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 5\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Every one of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people who know each other will shake hands with each of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people who know no one, so there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/a/01ac9d4c8b0917a49b50e910ffb75f3d8139e25d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20\\cdot 10 = 200$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"100\" height=\"13\" /> handshakes here. Each of the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people will also shake hands with each other, so there will be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/b/4/cb40ff56cb324c9ef3386811e726e129fe778024.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${10 \\choose 2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -22px\" width=\"42\" height=\"53\" /> <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/f/80fb2b10f59cfa80907eb8e4b032c592d49ffe7e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=45$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"36\" height=\"13\" /> handshakes for this case. In total, there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/5/0/6503e6c3afe7656610e824619d7191415e55bd43.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$200+45 = \\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 245}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -11px\" width=\"166\" height=\"30\" /> handshakes. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_6\">Solution 6</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 6\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since there are 10 people who know nobody, the have to shake hands with everybody but themselves, which is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/8/5487b850c91cf377aeba26683466d663126a42af.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$30 - 1 = 29$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"94\" height=\"15\" /> people. <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/7/a/97a76729786b3a23aef4eff8d253c2c9e4fdacdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10*29=290$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"107\" height=\"14\" />. Since people in pairs that belong to this group of 10, every internal handshake was counted twice, resulting in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/1/6/916bd1ca73a0dd3175bf928098d13fe97b40377f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"${10\\choose 2}=45$\" style=\"vertical-align: -23px\" width=\"91\" height=\"55\" /> overcounts. For the case where a person from group of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> shakes with a person from the group of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/8/3/f8366cd6196dd8a9da6d38a3e9eafb109e99d53e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$20$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" />, handshakes were only counted once. Unique handshakes involving the <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/c/6/fc606f7f1e530731ab4f1cc364c01dc64a4455ee.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$10$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"20\" height=\"14\" /> people <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/5/cd5304bbf3b3d2353fd27b020ac9addcbb7a71a6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=290-45=245$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"140\" height=\"15\" />. People from the group of 20 only shakes with the people from the group of 10, and every single one of those handshakes were already counted. Thus there are <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/1/bc1f9d9bf8a1b606a4188b5ce9a2af1809e27a89.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$0$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" /> new handshakes. The total amount of handshakes is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/4/7/347c4bdb36fa9242f056a400bdf1dc7140bd9ea4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\ 245}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -10px\" width=\"73\" height=\"28\" />. -erik54321\n</p><p><br />\n-Benedict T (countmath1)\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(HOW_TO_THINK_CREATIVELY!!!)\">Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (HOW TO THINK CREATIVELY!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/TCxjwO-I8kQ\">https://youtu.be/TCxjwO-I8kQ</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2017_AMC_12A_Problems/Problem_5&amp;action=edit&amp;section=9\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRF4Co5txJI\">https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=PRF4Co5txJI</a>\n</p><p>~Math4All99